  "description": {
   "en": "Written and organized by Gege Akutami, this official fan book offers a unique never-before-seen glimpse into the Jujutsu Kaisen world! Delve into the personal details of over 70 characters through a generous array of 350+ questions, all answered by Gege himself! Fans can also look forward to extra background information, exclusive interviews, and even an art trade with Tite Kubo, the author of the hit series, *BLEACH*! This book is a must read for all Jujutsu Kaisen fans!"
  },
